    "sub_name": "研究方法",
    "sub_ename": "RESEARCH METHODS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程探討自變數與應變數間關係，所介紹的統計方法包含多變量分析、迴歸分析、時間序列模型和事件研究法等等，藉此提升學生資料分析的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course uses statistical models to examine the possible relationship between dependent and independent variables, including multivariate analysis, regression analysis, time series models, event study, and so on. It can help students enhance the ability of data analysis.",
